  "findings": [
    {
      "topic": "持续输入与燃料预算",
      "observation": "use取实际hand栈；shift在server切ignite，否则startUsingItem(hand)。每个onUseTick以consumption*elapsed<=当前流体量作预算，循环8个散射方向；只有server addFreshEntity。onUseTick本身不扣油；releaseUsing重新读该栈当前流体，按结束elapsed整体shrink并写回/移除。不是每个喷射物单独扣费，也不是预留token事务。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerItem.java114–201",
        "IEItemInterfaces.java26–42",
        "FluidUtils.java62–72"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "原点与动量",
      "observation": "持物hand用于startUsingItem；喷射物经父构造出生在owner眼高，不从渲染枪口或手部mesh出发。基础构造先shoot，物品随后把速度设为玩家动量+带散射方向range。悬空时每个split都减小量反作用速度。focus/gas改变scatter/range，不拆案例。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerItem.java138–166",
        "IEProjectileEntity.java65–90"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "服务端命中与当前手",
      "observation": "ChemthrowerShotEntity.onHit只在server且fluid非空执行；有tag effect则将owner强转Player并取命中时当前MAIN_HAND栈，未保存原始发射hand/栈。普通温度hurt返回true才缩短invulnerableTime。效果callback不统一返回hurt成功，Potion分支甚至可以独立施加效果，不能称effect调用等于伤害成功。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerShotEntity.java125–165",
        "ChemthrowerHandler.java61–67,87–174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "NPC强转边界",
      "observation": "Bulwark的独立AI goal确实以自身为owner生成相同实体，固定使用ethanol；本模组Effects.register对ethanol只登记flammable、不登记effect。Player强转仅在effect!=null分支中；未查完整tag和外部扩展，不能宣称普通Bulwark链必然已崩溃。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerAttackGoal.java24–79",
        "ChemthrowerShotEntity.java134–145",
        "ChemthrowerEffects.java166–184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "火焰与碰撞清理",
      "observation": "喷射物可因可燃标签+点火开关或经过火/熔岩点燃；炎热流体和着火时还有额外命中分支。本类onHit没有调用super.onHit或统一discard，不能将一般“碰到”当作回收完成。混凝土/除草剂效果有明确区域discard。父类ticksInAir>=40或inGroundTime>=100移除后本方法没有立即return；其后仍调用super.tick。原版AbstractArrow完整影响未知。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerShotEntity.java89–165",
        "ChemthrowerEffects.java83–163",
        "IEProjectileEntity.java50,141–209,259–262"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "参数单位保留",
      "observation": "着火命中f从getRemainingFireTicks取值，却传给setSecondsOnFire；按API命名存在ticks/seconds边界，代码没有在此处除20。只标记静态调用，不把未读引擎实现或实测伤害时长当已确认。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerShotEntity.java154–163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "owner、同步与存档",
      "observation": "父类维护owner+shooterUUID、synched UUID和spawn packet；子类FluidStack同步由实际注册serializer写/读/copy，client baseTick会取同步值。子类没有自定义流体磁盘NBT，父类自定义NBT只额外存Owner；不能将同步数据当已验证的重载流体恢复。真实AbstractArrow/Entity存档生命周期未读。",
      "evidence": [
        "IEProjectileEntity.java39–98,112–127,269–311",
        "ChemthrowerShotEntity.java38–87,105–115",
        "IEEntityDataSerializers.java19–28",
        "IEFluid.java196–217",
        "IEContent.java136–148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "真正喷射材质",
      "observation": "renderer优先实体fluid后退synced；读取流体IClientFluidTypeExtensions的stillTexture在BLOCK_ATLAS取sprite，使用tint RGBA并取环境/流体亮度max，camera facing小四边形逐顶点UV0–4。TransformingVertexBuilder将pose后position、normal、UV、color、light真正交base.endVertex。getTextureLocation返回bullet.png没有被这段render选作采样材质。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerShotRenderer.java39–96",
        "TransformingVertexBuilder.java32–230",
        "ChemthrowerShotEntity.java167–179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "真正手持模型",
      "observation": "物品initializeClient注入USE_IEOBJ_RENDER；@Mod客户端构造注册chemthrower callback，生成JSON dynamic=true/loader=ie_obj/callback同名，并分别提供FP/TP左右手display。Loader→General覆盖栈/holder key→Specific applyTransform→IEOBJItemRenderer对可见组putBulkData链已接上。实际OBJ文件/MTL/PNG未查看，手部遮挡与视觉姿态未实机确认。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerItem.java73–78",
        "ImmersiveEngineering.java128–129",
        "ClientProxy.java115–155,170–177,495–516",
        "ItemCallback.java25–33",
        "chemthrower.json1–160",
        "IEOBJLoader.java43–69",
        "GeneralIEOBJModel.java279–288",
        "SpecificIEOBJModel.java125–129,161–184",
        "IEOBJItemRenderer.java50–131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "持姿与升级是上下文",
      "observation": "ChemthrowerCallbacks使用capacity/multitank选择base/grip/cage/tanks及容器组；额外旋转/平移仅holder instanceof Bulwark并TP hand。玩家使用动画返回NONE，四手持角度来自JSON；不把Bulwark回调当玩家举枪动画，不把各组另算案例。",
      "evidence": [
        "ChemthrowerCallbacks.java29–75",
        "ChemthrowerItem.java99–104",
        "models/item/chemthrower.json3–152"
      ]
    }
  ],
